    "contract": "Algorithm 3: local m/v/vhat, mix OLD x and raw half-step u; x_next=Wx-lr*m_next/sqrt(max(Wu,epsilon)); u_next=Wu+vhat_next-vhat_old. No bias correction. Floor is inside square root.",
    "initialization": "Shared seeded model; m0=v0=0; vhat0=u_half0=epsilon. Paper omits v0 from input line; explicit standard zero choice here. No bootstrap gradient.",
    "scope": "Fixed connected symmetric doubly stochastic Metropolis W; stable membership, local_steps=1, shared momentum=0, fully trainable common-dtype floating parameters, local buffers. Old model/tracker packet overlaps one charged gradient. No compression, current-denominator alternative, directed/time-varying mixing, local blocks, churn or LoRA.",
    "reference_comparison": "No authors implementation was executed or Reference label claimed. Numerical checks use independent paper equations and autograd gradients."
  },
